# Exploitation
To exploit it,I upload a "malicious payload11.pickle.gz " following the CVE poc, I put the whole path of the malicious pickle "#2Fvar#2Fwww#2Fresearch.bedside.htb#2Fuploads#payload11.pickle.gz" in the "malicious.pdf" that I also uploaded. Then I go at research.bedside.htb/uploads/malicious.pdf that I refresh until it works. HUH!
